      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "立方米？假如房间的长度是5.4米，宽4.2米，高2.75",
        "米，需要多少时间才能使整个房间换上新鲜空气？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "533",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：",
        "1) $25.116:3.12\\cdot(346.7-246.7)\\cdot(1.06+7.98)$；",
        "2) $25.047:4.14\\cdot(7.97+1.06)\\cdot(417.6-317.6)$."
      ]
